# Token budget (always on, short)

- Prefer targeted file reads over broad doc scans.
- **Fast path (default):** implement → verify → done. No mandatory doc pack, scope restatement, issue, or handoff update.
- **Non-trivial / multi-session work:** read `docs/sdlc/agent-handoff.md` only if continuity matters; pull other rules by description when needed.
- Keep replies concise: status, evidence, next 1–3 steps.
- Do not paste large docs into the chat when paths already exist in-repo.
